      "This file is a human-readable design plan, not a direct MC6 Pro import file.",
      "It is intended to capture desired functionality before converting it into Morningstar Editor presets and MIDI messages.",
      "The current backup shows active banks named Home, Ableton Guitar, Ableton Looper Voice, and Main Pedals."
    ]
